Subject: [PATCH 31/49] 0014c (L32 port): retain Mamba states N blocks below
 the replay boundary (B70_OFFLOAD_GDN_BACKSTEP=N)

Re-done on 0.32 (replay boundaries became the module function replay_boundaries); semantics of b70/v0.30.0 80aacb5725, tests from that commit.
---
